                                                "text": "She is also a descendant of our nation's third president, Thomas Jefferson, and his enslaved mistress, Sally Hemings.[...]\nShe holds the profound honor of being the first African American employed at the Thomas Jefferson Foundation.[...]\nHemings (1773-1835) is one of the most famous—and least known—African American women in U.S. history."
